82
00:04:49,356 --> 00:04:50,231
Quick check.

83
00:04:50,781 --> 00:04:52,295
What does a hypervisor do?

84
00:04:52,845 --> 00:04:53,912
What is the kernel?

85
00:04:54,462 --> 00:04:57,086
Why are containers lighter than virtual machines?

86
00:04:57,636 --> 00:04:59,492
When would you choose a virtual machine?

